  <metadata>
    <name>D21 Saimaa day – Savonlinna → Linnansaari</name>
    <desc>56 km road, ≈1.0 h riding. Rest day. Bike stays at the pier in Rantasalmi (Porosalmi); water taxi to Linnansaari NP. Optional log-rolling if available.</desc>
  </metadata>
